# Comparison pull for direction.md line 1's own disprove condition: "any cell
# where idle loses and good wins, at the same boss, size and difficulty."
# 2026-09-26-27.play (this session, style=idle) just wiped this exact cell --
# mode=raid, boss=gorged (The Bloodgorged), spec=priest:discipline, size=25,
# difficulty=heroic, fresh save -- at 134s, boss 6%, from the player's own
# death to `fester` (26 hits). src/sim/boss.ts's own comment on scheduleFester
# calls it "the only mechanic on this boss aimed squarely at the healers...
# the one dot in this game that must not be ridden out" -- exactly what an
# idle healer cannot answer. Running `good` on the identical cell, separate
# playbot invocation (never a second open #hash -- the fragment-clears-after-
# read lesson from 2026-09-25), to see whether active healing actually saves
# the pull rather than merely reading better.
open #b=gorged&s=25&h=1
tap class:priest:discipline
tap pull
waitscreen fight 20
state
shot opening
play good 200
state
shot ending
says
bill
